      "path": "/Users/gracker/Library/Mobile Documents/iCloud~md~obsidian/Documents/Obsidian/DeepResearch/2026-06-08-fuse-bpf-nonexistent-verification.md",
      "title": "Android 17 内核 FUSE-BPF 机制验证（FUSE-BPF 不存在，仅有 Passthrough）",
      "summary": "经源码三重验证（Kconfig/Makefile/文件列表），Android 17 kernel 6.18 不存在 FUSE-BPF 机制，仅有 FUSE passthrough。Android 17 特有补丁禁用了 CAP_SYS_ADMIN 权限检查、允许并发 passthrough/非 passthrough 模式，MediaProvider 支持双 passthrough 模式（FUSE_CAP_PASSTHROUGH / FUSE_CAP_PASSTHROUGH_UPSTREAM），对 Scoped Storage I/O 性能有实质影响。",
      "section": "ch06",
      "target_file": "src/part1-fundamentals/ch06-storage/07-fuse-bpf-scoped-storage-io-performance.md",
      "processed_at": "2026-06-07T22:13:47.009991+00:00",
      "type": "DeepResearch 调研结果"
    },
    {
      "path": "/Users/gracker/Library/Mobile Documents/iCloud~md~obsidian/Documents/Obsidian/DeepResearch/2026-06-08-android-statsd-config-cache-reregister.md",
      "title": "Android 16 StatsD 缓存与配置重注册链路（statsdReady 全量回灌机制）",
      "summary": "StatsManagerService 维护五类 ArrayMap 订阅缓存（puller/dataFetch/activeConfig/broadcastSubscriber/restrictedMetrics），native statsd 重启时通过 statsdReady() 信号触发 sayHiToStatsd() 全量重注册。客户端侧缓存是 authoritative state，native 端是 mirror，registerAll* 方法采用锁内浅拷贝+锁外 binder 调用模式避免 IPC 死锁。",
      "section": "ch14",
      "target_file": "src/part3-tools/ch14-other-tools/17-statsd-system-metrics.md",
      "processed_at": "2026-06-07T22:13:47.009991+00:00",
      "type": "DeepResearch 调研结果"
    },
    {
      "path": "/Users/gracker/Library/Mobile Documents/iCloud~md~obsidian/Documents/Obsidian/DeepResearch/2026-06-07-statsd-service-chain-validation.md",
      "title": "Android 17 StatsD 三层架构链路边界验证（StatsManagerService/StatsCompanionService/native daemon）",
      "summary": "StatsD 系统三层架构源码验证：Java 层 StatsManagerService 负责权限管理，StatsCompanionService 作为 JNI 桥接，native statsd 通过 StatsSocketListener 主循环处理事件。StatsdConfig 的 pull/push atom 需严格权限验证，数据通过 atrace.pbtxt 与 Perfetto 集成。Android 17 新增 DeviceConfig.NAMESPACE_STATSD_JAVA 命名空间和 READ_RESTRICTED_STATS 权限。",
      "section": "ch14",
      "target_file": "src/part3-tools/ch14-other-tools/17-statsd-system-metrics.md",
      "processed_at": "2026-06-07T22:13:47.009991+00:00",
      "type": "DeepResearch 调研结果"
    },
    {
      "path": "/Users/gracker/Library/Mobile Documents/iCloud~md~obsidian/Documents/Obsidian/DeepResearch/2026-06-07-android-17-binder-ipc-thread-scheduling-cooperation.md",
      "title": "Android 17 Binder IPC 线程池调度协同（ProcessState/IPCThreadState/内核 binder_select_thread）",
      "summary": "基于 android-16.0.0_r4 锚点的 Binder 线程池调度深度分析：DEFAULT_MAX_BINDER_THREADS=15 上限只能增大不能缩小，blockUntilThreadAvailable() 用 condition_variable 等待空闲 worker 配合 100ms 饥饿告警，内核 binder_select_thread_ilocked 从 waiting_threads 链表取 worker，binder_do_set_priority() 实现 RT 优先级继承三层入口。",
      "section": "ch01",
      "target_file": "src/part1-fundamentals/ch01-architecture/04-binder.md",
